# Ingest / upload

- Accept `.mxl`, `.musicxml`, `.xml` (ABC convert-once is later). Enforce **8 MB** size cap.
- **XXE:** strip external MusicXML DOCTYPE in [`lib/ingest/xml.ts`](../lib/ingest/xml.ts); reject ENTITY / internal subsets; decompress `.mxl` with zip-slip and bomb guards; parse with `fast-xml-parser` (`processEntities: false`).
- Require **license** before persist. Extract title/composer/key/time/parts from MusicXML header only at upload time.
- Store `scores/{id}/original.*` + `canonical.musicxml`; set `format`, `visibility`, `owner_id` (admin user).
- Never ship ingest parsers into public list/detail RSC pages.
- Page-1 preview SVG is generated in the admin browser after upload, stored in R2 — not on every catalog request.
